<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_tailoring.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tailoring</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<br/>
<br/>As displayed above, remember that you can also use <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/items/armor/min-level:232/side:2/class:7/weights:250:249:248:247:123:119:103:96:23/weight-values:63.333:63.333:63.333:100:3.333:3.333:3.333:3.333:0.567?filter=123:24:238:86;1:3:4:11;0:0:4:0#items">crafted gear</a> to fill in for any weaker gear slots!<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-gems">Best Gems for Elemental Shaman DPS - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Meta Socket - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41285/chaotic-skyflare-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chaotic Skyflare Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Red Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40113/runed-cardinal-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Cardinal Ruby</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40134/royal-dreadstone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Royal Dreadstone</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40155/reckless-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ametrine</span></a></div></li></ul>Because of Elemental's relatively low Hit cap, it is quite easy to hit it, even with pre-raid gear. Thus, you will want to mostly gem other stats, unless unlucky with Hit gear drops.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-enchants">Best Enchants for Elemental Shaman DPS - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
